Z||000000||Brandon86SE||11-20-2001||06:42 PM||||I'm just wondering who everyone's favorite concerts have been?  For me it'd be:<P>- Offspring (saw them this summer, best show I've ever seen!)<BR>- MxPx<BR>- Brian Adams/ Tom Cochrane (same show)<BR>- Slick Shoes<BR>- Dogwood/ Undecided (same show, 2 bands)<BR>- Less Than Jake<BR>- Five Iron Frenzy/ POD/ W's (festival)<BR>- Bif Naked/ Static in Stereo/ Live on Release<P>that's all I'll post, trying to keep the list short.<P>Now some bands I wish I'd been around to see:<P>- Supertramp<BR>- Queen<BR>- The Cars<BR>- Boston<BR>- CCR (but I did see Credence Clearwater Revisited with the original drummer, and bassist, and the guitarist from The Cars)<P>And finally, bands I have to see yet before I die:<P>- Phil Collins<BR>- Ghoti Hook<BR>- Reel Big Fish<BR>- Goldfinger<BR>- Sum 41<BR>- Blink 182<BR>- New Found Glory<BR>- Our Lady Peace<BR>- Matthew Good Band<BR>- Metallica<P>Ok, that's enough from me, I'm sure there's more I could add.  I'm a music lover!  I'm always listening to it.  Now let's hear from you!<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
