Z||000002||Nashco||11-20-2001||07:03 PM||||I have seen Offspring twice, and they do put on a damn good show.  Let's see, in order of my favorites:<P>1. Foo Fighters (Intense!)<BR>2. Moby<BR>3. Offspring<BR>4. Red Hot Chili Peppers<BR>5. Paul Oakenfeld<P>*edit* Forgot to mention, the Chili Peppers and Foo Fighters were from Row eight...talk about loud and in your face!<P>I've gone to one concert a year for the last five years or so, I'd like to go to more but I'm too cheap  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT<p>[This message has been edited by Nashco (edited 11-20-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||Cheever3000||11-20-2001||07:12 PM||||Favorite, for appreciation of musical talent: Kansas<P>Most fun performance to be in the audience: Bob Seger<P>Honorable mention: Emerson, Lake & Palmer; John Denver; Jimmy Spheeris<P>Enjoyed a free concert by Barry McGuire, singer/songwriter of the 60's <I>Eve of Destruction</I>, long since a Christian.<P>||||reg||6
Z||000004||Heretic||11-20-2001||07:15 PM||||I've only seen like 6 bands at 2 concerts. I've seen:<BR>- Staind<BR>- Finger Eleven<BR>- Slurppy Mundae<BR>- Puddle of Mudd<BR>- 6Gig<BR>- The Familiars.<P>Out of the 6 only 4 were good. Staind , Finger Eleven , Slurppy Mundae and 6Gig.<P>I really wanna see:<BR>- Korn<BR>- Slipknot<BR>- Mudvayne<BR>- Adema<BR>- System of a Down<BR>- TOOL<BR>- A perfect Circle<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hereticsig_copy.jpg">         <BR>It will be mine , o yes , it will be mine! :)||||reg||6
