Z||000020||2birds||11-20-2001||10:13 PM||||Haven't been to many concerts, due to the ridiculously high prices.<P>My favorite was Rush (Hold Your Fire tour, 1988).  Would have loved to have been there for the making of All the World's a Stage.<P>I saw Buddy Guy a month ago at a small club in Jacksonville.  He played for 2-1/2 hours.  I sat 5 feet from the stage.  Lost a bit of hearing, I'm sure.<P>Next would be REO Speedwagon back in '85.<P>In their heyday, I would have loved to have seen Lynrd Skynrd, Journey, Styx, Foreigner, Alice Cooper (back in the 70's), and the original Van Halen.  <P>Blue Oyster Cult is my next concert goal.||||reg||1
